// OP_PUSH_TX: Extract All Transaction Fields
//
// Demonstrates every preimage extraction macro available.
// Each macro expands to real Bitcoin Script opcodes at parse time.
// Toggle "ASM" view to see the compiled output.
//
// Initial stack (bottom to top):
//   <preimage>        BIP-143 sighash preimage
//
// checkPreimage consumes nothing and leaves the preimage where it found it,
// ready for the extractors.
//
// In simulated mode (default), the extractors slice real byte offsets, so the
// item must be a full-length dummy preimage:
//   
//
// How OP_PUSH_TX works:
//   checkPreimage compiles to a fixed 428-byte run that derives an ECDSA
//   signature over hash256(preimage) in script and checks it with
//   OP_CHECKSIGVERIFY against a fixed public key. The node only accepts the
//   spend if the preimage on the stack is the one it is signing, so no
//   signature comes from the spender and a forged preimage cannot pass.
//   Once verified, extractors slice the preimage at known offsets.

// --- Verify preimage authenticity ---
checkPreimage

// --- BIP-143 Preimage Fields ---
// Each extractor consumes the preimage, so dup before each one.

// nVersion: transaction version number (4 bytes → number)
// Offset: bytes 0-3
dup extractVersion
drop

// hashPrevouts: hash of all input outpoints (32 bytes)
// Offset: bytes 4-35
dup extractHashPrevouts
drop

// hashSequence: hash of all input nSequence values (32 bytes)
// Offset: bytes 36-67
dup extractHashSequence
drop

// outpoint: txid + vout of the input being spent (36 bytes)
// Offset: bytes 68-103
dup extractOutpoint
drop

// inputIndex: which input is being signed (4 bytes → number)
// Offset: bytes 100-103
dup extractInputIndex
drop

// amount: satoshis in the UTXO being spent (8 bytes → number)
// Offset: size-52 to size-44
dup extractAmount
drop

// nSequence: this input's sequence number (4 bytes → number)
// Offset: size-44 to size-40
dup extractSequence
drop

// hashOutputs: hash256 of all outputs (32 bytes)
// Offset: size-40 to size-8
dup extractOutputHash
drop

// nLocktime: transaction locktime (4 bytes → number)
// Offset: size-8 to size-4
dup extractLocktime
drop

// sighashType: signature hash flags (4 bytes → number)
// Usually 0x41 = SIGHASH_ALL | SIGHASH_FORKID
extractSigHashType
drop

true
